# The repository stores text with LF. Git for Windows checks text out with
# CRLF when core.autocrlf is true, and other clients (such as devkitPro's
# MSYS2 git) do not convert at all. These rules keep every client from
# committing CRLF and from reporting a CRLF checkout as modified.
* text=auto

# Read by bash under WSL and by git apply; keep LF in every checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
